{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_77_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_77","text":"勝鬘師子吼經校勘說明","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_77_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_77","text":"一．是書校歷二週．一譯校．二刻校。","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_77_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_77","text":"二．譯校凡用兩種異譯對勘。（一）唐菩提流志譯勝鬘夫人會．〈大寶積經第四十八會〉校","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_77_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_77","text":"註略稱唐本。（二）西藏勝友等譯聖勝鬘夫人師子吼大乘經．〈亦編入大寶積經第四","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_77_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_77","text":"十八會〉略稱藏本。兩種並擧則稱二本。","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_77_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_77","text":"三．譯校凡有三例。（一）異譯文異堪資考究者．悉註出曰．某本雲雲。（二）異譯意暢","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_77_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_77","text":"可供參證者．悉註出曰．勘某本意雲雲。（三）因對勘異譯而見今文訛略者．亦註","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_77_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_77","text":"出曰．勘某本雲雲．今譯雲雲。","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_77_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_77","text":"四．刻校用南宋刻爲底本．對校麗刻訂正文字．附註曰．原刻雲雲．依麗刻雲雲。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_77_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_77","text":"五．校勘資料出處如次。","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_77_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_77","text":"（一）唐譯勝鬘夫人會．金陵刻經處印本大寶積經第一百十九卷。","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_77_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_77","text":"（二）藏譯聖勝鬘夫人師子吼大乘經．H!phags-padpal-ldanlha-mosen%-geh!isga-sgrogs-pashes-bya-batheg-pachen-poh!imdo．奈旦版甘珠.寶積部cha","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_77_13","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_77","text":"字函．四一九頁上至四五五頁下。","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_77_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_77","text":"（三）本書南宋刻及麗刻．悉依日本弘教書院縮刷正藏本及大正大藏經本","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_77_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_77","text":"之校註。","sortOrder":15}],"overrides":{}}